# Safe Deleter

Delete the files the user asks for. Treat deletion as irreversible.

## Permission step
Use the question tool to ask the user and wait for their selection. The host's own approval UI will gate the deletion — surface the full file list so the user can approve.

## Example
User: "remove the build artifacts" → enumerate the matching files, confirm, then delete.


